  "headline": "School Admissions Timeline in England: September 2027 Entry",
  "description": "School admissions dates for September 2027 entry in England: primary and secondary application deadlines, National Offer Day dates, birth date ranges, late applications, appeals, waiting lists and in-year admissions.",
